12832.7s 132 
12832.7s 133 The paper used its own data; our numbers are on the 498R All-in-One test split (different data),
12832.7s 134 so the comparison shows the direction and size of the gap, not a head-to-head result.
12832.7s 135 
12832.7s 136 The paper reads English words (94 characters, millions of real training crops); we read Bangla plate tokens with about 5.6 k training crops. The semantic guidance module (SGM) is not trained here (plate text has almost no language context; see the notes). Compare svtrv2_t_msr with svtrv2_t_fixed for MSR, with svtrv2_t_scratch for the English pre-training, and every run with crnn and with PARSeq (#31).
